message: "If you use or adapt this starter kit, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "Own the Context, Rent the Model: starter kit"
abstract: >-
  Topic-free template repository for a local, auditable research assistant:
  an agent-maintained, page-anchored literature memory in plain text, agent
  contracts, maintenance scripts, and a number guard that binds manuscript
  numbers to a frozen run or a sourced register.
